        "status": "pass",
        "summary": "The saved GDB feasibility probe attached without elevation to a disposable same-UID Python process, returned four readable thread stacks with 86 frame lines and one main-thread unwind warning, detached cleanly, and left cleanup to reap the child. This proves feasibility only for that Python target; it does not establish FFmpeg attach or source behavior. Saved r4/r5 timing and futex evidence continues to localize jitter after DQBUF and before raw-pipe delivery without causal proof."
